{"id":"625855","name":"薤白全麦蛋饼","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/625855/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"野葱","amount":"适量(含薤白)"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"全麦粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"野葱，只要薤白太浪费，茎叶也不要扔哈。","img":"images/625855/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净。","img":"images/625855/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切末。","img":"images/625855/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放碗里，加食盐和小许食用油。","img":"images/625855/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/625855/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放鸡蛋。","img":"images/625855/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅匀放小许清水。","img":"images/625855/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅匀。","img":"images/625855/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放面粉。","img":"images/625855/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搅拌至无颗粒状的面糊。","img":"images/625855/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/625855/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"油热放面糊摊成小饼。","img":"images/625855/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"一面金黄翻面。","img":"images/625855/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"再翻面。","img":"images/625855/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/625855/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}